900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VNXgJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C75DE572-EE99-4799-BE1A-7DA90CEDB6F4","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"レアだったのはBIツール用のDBでOracle→Netezzaの移行かな","ts":"1634784358.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0RB="}]},{"client_msg_id":"71461e4c-c7f0-4102-b17b-8f831bd04253","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"うちがMySQL一筋なのでまさにmattnさんの言ってる通りかなと思います\nOracleが昔はなんやかんや最強でそれに近いのがPostgreなんすよねたしか","ts":"1634784316.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"479"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3daf1a07-51f6-4232-a35a-23d8f87b61d6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"正直 2021 年に Oracle 選ぶ理由は壊れた時のサポートくらいしかないと思ってる。","ts":"1634784297.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9SNi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33585887-0d99-461c-905e-2096a6d34fa9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ユーザ企業がゼロからお金使わずに高性能な DB として MySQL を選んでそのまま MySQL ってパターンが多かったのかな。","ts":"1634784264.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f+L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35A0E41D-49AE-402B-9E91-DA37362DA886","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"1回だけなのはSQL serverとDynamoDBか","ts":"1634784193.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XwF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b25d11a-7e31-4c4c-89e6-c8f2aeacdac3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"公共関連のシステムだと MySQL ほぼゼロですね。","ts":"1634784174.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GPf=c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4B4B2280-2837-4E47-9958-73A5D7DD806C","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"仕事だとPostgresかOracleの所が多かったな","ts":"1634784116.010300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/iQT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7562a6dd-8bfb-475f-b130-046a26edc19e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"LAMP の人は InnoDB しか知らないんですよね","ts":"1634784078.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ttSfR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f004e8a-1272-4666-b906-8004d4dedf94","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"逆にMySQLから入ると、PostgreSQLの振る舞いに面喰らいそう。","ts":"1634784027.008200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634784043.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qQB7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73344d77-a86b-490d-be8b-5a38f42f9c1f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"RDBMS+SQLを期待してると、面喰らいますよねw","ts":"1634784007.007800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634784037.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eg1f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69daa8ef-ae12-4032-9928-d126d7627b74","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"InnoDB が緩さを与えたけど InnoDB は色んな物が動かないし、気を付けて使わないと逆にコスト高いからなぁ。","ts":"1634783986.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8CdPK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9858c91-375c-4549-821c-97ae40949d80","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"対してMySQLが利用されていた分野では、MySQL自身がRDBMSとしての振る舞いがかなり緩くてそれに依存してしまってて、ガチガチなPostgreSQLに移行するのはコスト高なんじゃなかろか。","ts":"1634783922.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0FxZT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f13492d3-6c0e-462b-bc7e-f4863ea03479","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"OracleとPostgreSQLは方向が一緒で、過去においてはPostgreSQLが劣っていたけど、最近は大半の用途で置き換えられるようになった印象。","ts":"1634783839.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ul5=M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e74123f-c8bf-4e19-9424-923a1a3a612a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"PostgreSQLとMySQLはそもそも用途が違うというか、向いていた方向が違うような。","ts":"1634783768.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RwZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfbf5b99-6a51-4b32-b133-fe573d457fab","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"結構挙動が違う(はずな)ので、既存プロダクトを乗り換えるのはそんなに無いかもですね\nMySQLのことしか知らない人も多いので…","ts":"1634782994.003100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u7Z=w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7e39ba7-0d95-4090-8663-f220f2d76052","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"SI 業な人達が (Struts がそうだった様に)、PostgreSQL にコントリビュートし始めて一気に形勢逆転した感ある。","ts":"1634782339.002000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fa0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e8f04da-3eb2-4566-bae6-b0334f6b802a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"昔は MySQL 使うメリット沢山あったけど、今だともうほぼトントンというか、物によっては PostgreSQL の方が良かったりする物あるんだけど、MySQL から PostgreSQL にシフトする動きってあったりするんだろうか。","ts":"1634782292.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Rd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91ca5e20-0507-4f4c-8cf4-f9bb46c64d14","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GeoJSONをS2に変換して二分探査という原始的な方式。これで機能するんだから面白い。","ts":"1634785484.028300","thread_ts":"1634785431.027700","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gf6Y"}]}]
